1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
Watch the impulse.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:08,554
Skin, into the dorsal horn, across the relay neuron, out through the ventral root, to the muscle.

3
00:00:08,554 --> 00:00:10,507
About twenty milliseconds.

4
00:00:10,507 --> 00:00:16,861
A branch also climbs to the brain, which is why you feel the pain only after your hand has moved.

5
00:00:16,861 --> 00:00:19,986
The brain is informed, but not consulted.

